[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_MAGICAL]
One Small Thing

[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_MAGICAL_desc]
Equestria is a place of magic and friendship, so it’s no surprise that anything, no matter how ridiculous, can happen.
“One small thing doesn’t seem like a lot”
“One small thing, work with the time you’ve got”
“Soon, one small thing becomes two”
“After two, perhaps another few”
“Then one small thing is not so small”
“One small thing can be the biggest thing of all”

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_MAGICAL]
一件小事

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_MAGICAL_desc]
小马利亚是一个充满魔法和友谊的地方，所以不要惊讶，任何事情，无论多么荒谬，都可能发生。
“一件小事似乎不是很多”
“但至少还有一件小事可以和你一起度过”
“很快，一件小事变成了两件”
“之后，也许再来几件”
“那么一件小事就不再渺小”
“一件小事可能是最重要的事情”
